          "snippet": {
            "line": 1314,
            "text": "theorem nominalCoefficients_zero_fields {p : ℝ × ℝ} (hX : 0 ≤ p.1) (heta : |p.2| ≤ 1) :\n    (nominalCoefficients W).phi 0 p = W.axis.normalization * W.f p ∧\n    (nominalCoefficients W).axial 0 p = W.U p ∧\n    (nominalCoefficients W).pressure 0 p = W.Pi p"
